{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 41, :comments ["<b>And every swarming thing that swarms upon the earth</b> — The reason for this verse is that above (verses 29–30) Scripture mentioned the swarming creatures in connection with ritual impurity and specified those that are impure, but it did not speak there concerning the prohibition of eating at all. Therefore it now says, \"and every swarming thing that swarms upon the earth is an abomination, it shall not be eaten,\" to say that regarding the matter of eating there is no distinction between them — all are forbidden. And it returned and specified concerning them and multiplied concerning them negative prohibitions for lashes, as Rashi mentioned."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:53:06.492210107Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}